So there's a whole bunch more stuff coming
in the next couple of days.

00:12:19.529 --> 00:12:22.360
We got some teasers for season six

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.829
around this time last year.

00:12:23.829 --> 00:12:28.019
I'm not expecting a season seven teaser for
at least a little while longer.

00:12:28.019 --> 00:12:29.959
Maybe when we get closer to the Super Bowl.

